## Where things are

| Path | What |
|---|---|
| `CONSTITUTION.md` | project charter — human-owned, outranks everything |
| `.anthill/roles/` | role definitions |
| `.anthill/contracts/` | units in flight — read-only |
| `.anthill/sprints/current.json` | what this sprint contains |
| `.anthill/audits/` | audit findings, pinned to the commit audited |
| `.anthill/knowledge/` | recorded intent — pages and rules |
| `.anthill/build/maps/` | the blueprint (generated) |
| `.anthill/log/lessons/` | lessons, filed by area so they resurface |
| `.anthill/skills/INDEX.md` | reusable instruction — read with `{{ANTHILL}} skill get <name>` |
